language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario SimulatorWireAction.
condition SimulatorWireActionReady.
condition SimulatorWireActionContinue.
condition SimulatorWireActionReject.
outcome SimulatorWireActionCompleted.
outcome SimulatorWireActionRejected.
step SimulatorWireActionIntent.
step SimulatorWireActionAccept.
step SimulatorWireActionEmit.
step SimulatorWireActionDecode.
step SimulatorWireActionReduce.
step SimulatorWireActionFailure.
step SimulatorWireActionSuccess.

SimulatorWireAction illustrates OperateSimulation.
SimulatorWireAction exercises DeterministicTargetSimulation.
SimulatorWireAction starts-when SimulatorWireActionReady.
SimulatorWireAction starts-at SimulatorWireActionIntent.
SimulatorWireActionReady describes "Simulator-only control action is requested in Simulated mode.".
SimulatorWireActionContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
SimulatorWireActionReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
SimulatorWireActionCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
SimulatorWireActionRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
SimulatorWireAction preserves HiddenTruthIsolated.
SimulatorWireAction preserves StableCommandIdentity.
SimulatorWireActionIntent calls RouteSimulatorIntent within SimulatorUI.
SimulatorWireActionIntent describes "Same identity through POST/retry/lookup.".
SimulatorWireActionIntent proceeds-to SimulatorWireActionFailure when SimulatorWireActionReject.
SimulatorWireActionIntent proceeds-to SimulatorWireActionAccept when SimulatorWireActionContinue.
SimulatorWireActionAccept calls HandleSimulatorControl within P1000Simulator.
SimulatorWireActionAccept describes "Validate and deduplicate simulator command.".
SimulatorWireActionAccept proceeds-to SimulatorWireActionFailure when SimulatorWireActionReject.
SimulatorWireActionAccept proceeds-to SimulatorWireActionEmit when SimulatorWireActionContinue.
SimulatorWireActionEmit calls EmitSimulatedWire within P1000Simulator.
SimulatorWireActionEmit describes "Emit literal mapped wire form with simulated provenance.".
SimulatorWireActionEmit proceeds-to SimulatorWireActionFailure when SimulatorWireActionReject.
SimulatorWireActionEmit proceeds-to SimulatorWireActionDecode when SimulatorWireActionContinue.
SimulatorWireActionDecode calls DecodeP1000Frames within MachineService.
SimulatorWireActionDecode describes "Exercise the real target/parser path.".
SimulatorWireActionDecode proceeds-to SimulatorWireActionFailure when SimulatorWireActionReject.
SimulatorWireActionDecode proceeds-to SimulatorWireActionReduce when SimulatorWireActionContinue.
SimulatorWireActionReduce calls ReduceMachineState within MachineService.
SimulatorWireActionReduce describes "Publish normalized machine fact separately from hidden truth.".
SimulatorWireActionReduce proceeds-to SimulatorWireActionFailure when SimulatorWireActionReject.
SimulatorWireActionReduce proceeds-to SimulatorWireActionSuccess when SimulatorWireActionContinue.
SimulatorWireActionFailure finishes SimulatorWireAction with SimulatorWireActionRejected.
SimulatorWireActionSuccess finishes SimulatorWireAction with SimulatorWireActionCompleted.
SimulatorWireActionIntent emits SimulatorControlRequests through SimulatorControlChannel.
SimulatorWireActionAccept receives SimulatorControlRequests through SimulatorControlChannel.
SimulatorWireActionEmit emits TargetResponses through TargetChannel.
SimulatorWireActionDecode receives TargetResponses through TargetChannel.
